  "prefLabel": "Per 102.27 Competitive promotion",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Per 102.27 “Competitive promotion” means a change in job title and placement within a pay band with a higher minimum rate of pay, resulting from selection of the employee at the conclusion of a competitive recruitment process.\n\nSource. #13667, eff 6-22-23; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.22), eff 12-1-25",
